-- The owner reviewed every preset clip against its prompt on 2026-11-04 (frames from each prod sample clip beside the current and proposed text) and
-- approved these rewrites: the prompt now describes what the clip shows, and a label that misnamed the clip is renamed. A prompt or label an Admin or
-- editor has already changed is left as it is. Each change is audited as preset.update by the system (no actor).
WITH v(id, old_label, new_label, old_prompt, new_prompt) AS (VALUES
	('gentle-push-in', U&'Ti\1ebfn g\1ea7n nh\1eb9 nh\00e0ng', U&'C\1eadn c\1ea3nh l\1ea5p l\00e1nh', 'Slow, gentle push-in toward the product on a clean, plain background with soft even lighting. Keep the product, its shape, colours and any printed text exactly unchanged. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. No faces. Smooth, stable camera.', 'An extreme macro close-up of the product filling the frame, with a nearly still camera that drifts only very slightly. Bright, sparkling highlights glint and shimmer across its surfaces, set against a softly blurred background of glittering bokeh in warm, low light. Keep the product, its shape, colours and any printed text exactly unchanged. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. No faces. Smooth, stable camera.'),
	('slow-orbit', U&'Xoay quanh ch\1eadm', U&'Xoay ch\1eadm t\1ea1i ch\1ed7', 'The camera moves in a slow, small arc in front of the product on a clean background, showing only the sides visible in the image. Keep the product, its shape, colours and any printed text exactly unchanged. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. No faces. Smooth, stable camera.', 'The product slowly rotates in place, as if on a turntable, while the camera holds still at eye level. A dark, plain backdrop and a warm, low-key side light pick out its form, with soft highlights moving across the surface as it turns. Keep the product, its shape, colours and any printed text exactly unchanged. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. No faces. Smooth, stable camera.'),
	('lifestyle-table', U&'\0110\1eb7t tr\00ean b\00e0n \0111\1eddi th\01b0\1eddng', U&'\0110\1eb7t tr\00ean b\00e0n \0111\1eddi th\01b0\1eddng', 'The product sits on a tidy wooden table in a bright, cozy room, with a slow subtle camera drift and natural daylight. Keep the product, its shape, colours and any printed text exactly unchanged. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. No faces. Smooth, stable camera.', 'The product sits on a rustic, dark wooden table with everyday props softly blurred around it, in warm, moody indoor light. The camera holds still at a close, slightly high angle with a shallow depth of field, keeping the product sharp and centred. Keep the product, its shape, colours and any printed text exactly unchanged. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. No faces. Smooth, stable camera.'),
	('light-sweep', U&'\00c1nh s\00e1ng qu\00e9t nh\1eb9', U&'L\01b0\1edbt g\1ea7n l\1ea5p l\00e1nh', 'A soft band of light slowly sweeps across the product, adding gentle highlights and reflections, with a nearly still camera. Keep the product, its shape, colours and any printed text exactly unchanged. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. No faces. Smooth, stable camera.', 'The camera glides slowly and smoothly closer to the product, which rests on a dark, polished wooden surface. Warm, dim light catches its edges, so small sparkling highlights travel and twinkle across it as the view shifts, with a shallow depth of field and a softly blurred background. Keep the product, its shape, colours and any printed text exactly unchanged. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. No faces. Smooth, stable camera.'),
	('floating-reveal', U&'S\1ea3n ph\1ea9m bay l\00ean', U&'S\1ea3n ph\1ea9m l\01a1 l\1eedng', 'The product floats up slowly into frame and settles in the centre against a soft gradient background, with a gentle camera rise. Keep the product, its shape, colours and any printed text exactly unchanged. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. No faces. Smooth, stable camera.', 'The product hovers in mid-air at the centre of the frame above a seamless, warm pastel floor, bobbing very gently, with a soft shadow on the ground beneath it. The camera stays still, and soft, even studio lighting keeps the scene clean and minimal. Keep the product, its shape, colours and any printed text exactly unchanged. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. No faces. Smooth, stable camera.'),
	('shoulder-sequence', U&'C\1eadn vai r\1ed3i to\00e0n th\00e2n', U&'C\1eadn chi ti\1ebft r\1ed3i to\00e0n th\00e2n', 'The camera starts on a close-up of the garment detail at the shoulder and waist, then pulls back to reveal the model posing in the full outfit. Keep the person, their face, the outfit, its colours and any printed text exactly as in the image. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. Smooth, stable camera.', 'The clip opens on a medium shot of the model standing calmly against a plain studio backdrop, cuts to a close-up of the garment''s drape and detail at the waist as a hand lightly touches the fabric, then ends on a wide full-body shot of the model posing in the full outfit. Keep the person, their face, the outfit, its colours and any printed text exactly as in the image. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. Smooth, stable camera.'),
	('turn-around', U&'Xoay m\1ed9t v\00f2ng', U&'Lia v\00f2ng ra sau l\01b0ng', 'The model slowly turns around on the spot to show the back of the outfit while the camera circles gently with them. Keep the person, their face, the outfit, its colours and any printed text exactly as in the image. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. Smooth, stable camera.', 'The camera orbits slowly around the model, who stays in place in a relaxed pose, moving from a front view past the side to a view of the back of the outfit. Natural daylight and the surroundings shift with the camera''s path. Keep the person, their face, the outfit, its colours and any printed text exactly as in the image. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. Smooth, stable camera.'),
	('studio-poise', U&'T\1ea1o d\00e1ng studio', U&'T\1ea1o d\00e1ng studio', 'In a clean studio, the model shifts weight, touches the collar and settles into a confident pose with a slight smile; the camera stays almost still. Keep the person, their face, the outfit, its colours and any printed text exactly as in the image. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. Smooth, stable camera.', 'In a bright studio with a plain light backdrop, the model moves through a few relaxed poses, hands in pockets, a hand on the hip, a touch of the hair, then settles with a calm look at the camera, as the camera slowly pushes in from a three-quarter shot to waist-up. Keep the person, their face, the outfit, its colours and any printed text exactly as in the image. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. Smooth, stable camera.'),
	('head-to-toe-shot', U&'Qu\00e9t t\1eeb ch\00e2n l\00ean \0111\1ea7u', U&'Qu\00e9t t\1eeb ch\00e2n l\00ean \0111\1ea7u', 'The camera starts low on the shoes and tilts up along the outfit to the face, ending on a full-body shot of the model. Keep the person, their face, the outfit, its colours and any printed text exactly as in the image. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. Smooth, stable camera.', 'The camera starts low and close on the legs and shoes as the model walks slowly forward, then rises and pulls back along the outfit until the model stops and stands, ending on a full-body shot from head to toe. Keep the person, their face, the outfit, its colours and any printed text exactly as in the image. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. Smooth, stable camera.'),
	('minimal-motion', U&'Chuy\1ec3n \0111\1ed9ng t\1ed1i gi\1ea3n', U&'Chuy\1ec3n \0111\1ed9ng t\1ed1i gi\1ea3n', 'The model stands almost still, with subtle breathing, a small shift of weight and a slow blink; the camera holds steady. Keep the person, their face, the outfit, its colours and any printed text exactly as in the image. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. Smooth, stable camera.', 'The model stands in front of a plain draped backdrop and shifts between a few small, relaxed poses: hands in pockets, a hand at the waist, then arms resting at the sides with a calm, steady gaze. The camera pushes in very slowly from a full-body shot to a knee-up framing. Keep the person, their face, the outfit, its colours and any printed text exactly as in the image. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. Smooth, stable camera.'),
	('doberman-gaze', U&'\00c1nh nh\00ecn s\1eafc l\1ea1nh', U&'\00c1nh nh\00ecn b\00ean ch\00f3 Doberman', 'The model stands still in a bold setting and slowly turns their gaze to the camera; a static camera with very subtle movement. Keep the person, their face, the outfit, its colours and any printed text exactly as in the image. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. Smooth, stable camera.', 'The model stands still against a bold, plain wall in hard, bright sunlight under a clear sky. A sleek dark dog walks calmly into frame and stops beside them, while the model slowly lifts their gaze to the camera with a cool, steady expression. The camera pushes in very slightly. Keep the person, their face, the outfit, its colours and any printed text exactly as in the image. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. Smooth, stable camera.'),
	('runway-walk', U&'S\1ea3i b\01b0\1edbc catwalk', U&'S\1ea3i b\01b0\1edbc catwalk', 'The model walks straight towards the camera with a confident runway stride; the camera holds its position and keeps the full outfit in frame. Keep the person, their face, the outfit, its colours and any printed text exactly as in the image. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. Smooth, stable camera.', 'The model walks straight towards the camera with a confident runway stride in a bright, minimal space, while the camera tracks backwards at the same pace to keep the full outfit in frame from head to toe. Keep the person, their face, the outfit, its colours and any printed text exactly as in the image. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. Smooth, stable camera.'),
	('outfit-check', U&'Ng\1eafm tr\1ecdn b\1ed9 \0111\1ed3', U&'Ng\1eafm tr\1ecdn b\1ed9 \0111\1ed3', 'A quick outfit check: the full look, then close-ups of the jacket, skirt and accessories, then the model turns to show the back. Keep the person, their face, the outfit, its colours and any printed text exactly as in the image. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. Smooth, stable camera.', 'A quick outfit check in a few cuts: a wide shot of the full look, close-ups of the top, the bottom and any accessories, then the model turns their head, adjusts the outfit while facing the camera, and finally turns to show the back. Keep the person, their face, the outfit, its colours and any printed text exactly as in the image. Do not add any text, logos or watermarks. Smooth, stable camera.')
), changed AS (
	UPDATE "presets" p SET
		"label" = CASE WHEN p."label" = v.old_label THEN v.new_label ELSE p."label" END,
		"prompt" = CASE WHEN p."prompt" = v.old_prompt THEN v.new_prompt ELSE p."prompt" END,
		"updated_at" = now()
	FROM v
	WHERE p."id" = v.id AND ((p."label" = v.old_label AND v.old_label <> v.new_label) OR (p."prompt" = v.old_prompt AND v.old_prompt <> v.new_prompt))
	RETURNING p."id", v.old_label, v.old_prompt, p."label", p."prompt"
)
INSERT INTO "audit_entries" ("actor_id", "action", "target", "old_value", "new_value")
SELECT NULL, 'preset.update', 'preset:' || c."id",
	jsonb_strip_nulls(jsonb_build_object('label', CASE WHEN c."label" <> c.old_label THEN c.old_label END, 'prompt', CASE WHEN c."prompt" <> c.old_prompt THEN c.old_prompt END)),
	jsonb_strip_nulls(jsonb_build_object('label', CASE WHEN c."label" <> c.old_label THEN c."label" END, 'prompt', CASE WHEN c."prompt" <> c.old_prompt THEN c."prompt" END))
FROM changed c;
